# A full ollie on a flat stretch of Dolores is not a crest air: the old crest-gap line (crouched
# down from 20th, two powerslides to scrub speed, the pop on 18th St's flat intersection at 29 km/h)
# flies 115 ticks (114 before the park carve), but the takeoff is not on the crest at 19th: no DOLORES CREST
# AIR, no SENT IT ON DOLORES (they paid any full ollie anywhere on Dolores, every second).
park sf
spawn dolores_bomb
cmd 0 traffic clear
hold up 20..200
hold ollie 200..1664
hold slide 1220..1290
hold slide 1560..1630
run 1800
expect event pop within 1664..1666
expect event land{airTicks=115} within 1777..1781
expect no event gap
expect no event bail
